<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the six months from March 1997, issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 309</p>
<p>firms conducted from March 3-18. Figures in brackets show the</p>
<p>change from February's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>			    Good	    Normal	    Bad</p>
<p>Germany		0.6 (+0.2)    41.9 (+1.6)    57.5(- 1.8)</p>
<p>U.S.		  86.1 (+1.8)    13.9 (-1.8)     0.0(+-0.0)</p>
<p>Japan		  0.4 (-0.3)    19.3 (+3.7)    80.3 (-3.4)</p>
<p>Britain	     54.2 (+0.8)    44.1 (-0.8)     1.7(+-0.0)</p>
<p>France		 0.7 (+0.7)    58.3 (+4.3)    41.0 (-5.0)</p>
<p>Italy		  1.1 (-0.0)    66.2 (+1.1)    32.7 (-1.1)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			   Improve	 No change	 Worsen</p>
<p>Germany	     67.6 (+3.3)    30.5 (-3.2)     1.9 (-0.9)</p>
<p>U.S.		   7.9 (+0.2)    89.1 (+2.8)     3.0 (-3.0)</p>
<p>Japan		 54.9 (+3.2)    42.0 (-1.5)     3.1 (-1.7)</p>
<p>Britain	     11.1 (-0.5)    81.7 (+0.9)     7.2 (-0.4)</p>
<p>France		59.1 (+3.6)    39.2 (-3.2)     1.7 (-0.4)</p>
<p>Italy		 35.4 (+0.4)    61.4 (-0.4)     3.2(+-0.0)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p>Banks		 54.8 (+4.8)    40.7 (-4.4)     4.5 (-0.4)</p>
<p>Insurance	   33.7 (+5.9)    59.3 (-3.4)     7.0 (-2.5)</p>
<p>Automotives	 84.3 (+2.3)    14.0 (-2.2)     1.7 (-0.1)</p>
<p>Chemicals	   74.6 (-4.7)    23.6 (+4.0)     1.8 (+0.7)</p>
<p>Steel		 63.8 (+8.2)    31.3 (-7.8)     4.9 (-0.4)</p>
<p>Electronics	 65.5(+11.5)    32.4(-11.5)     2.1(+-0.0)</p>
<p>Engineering	 81.7 (+2.0)    15.8 (-1.3)     2.5 (-0.7)</p>
<p>Consumer goods    16.1 (+4.1)    65.4 (+7.4)     18.5(-11.5)</p>
<p>Trade		 14.0 (+2.6)    67.8 (+7.2)     18.2 (-9.8)</p>
<p>Construction	 8.3 (-1.2)    37.5 (-0.9)     54.2 (+2.1)</p>
